# The helper CLI splices bytes into *-designer.go and writes LF, and gofmt
# normalises the whole file to LF whenever it rewrites one. A checkout with
# CRLF would turn every designer edit into a mixed-ending file and a
# whole-file diff, so the working tree is LF on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures the tests compare byte for byte.
test/*.json -text

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.vsix binary
*.exe binary
